9	 *
10	 * <p>TIER is {@code "PREMIUM"} when the owner's effective membership level (see
11	 * {@link MembershipLevels#cappedLevelFor(Owner)}) is 3 or more, otherwise
12	 * {@code "STANDARD"}. AREA is {@code "METRO"} when the owner's locality (see
